        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highland_Lake%2C_Alabama"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Highland Lake evolved from a wilderness valley into a lake community that offers recreational facilities to hundreds annually.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
