        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.highlandlakeal.gov/history"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Shuff Lake’s 31.5‑square‑mile watershed and 900‑foot elevation made it the highest lake of its size in the southeastern United States.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
